### 1. 화장실 목록 조회 (GET 요청)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
GET {{baseUrl}}/restrooms


### 2. 화장실 생성 (POST 요청)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restrooms/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Central Park",
  "lat": 37.77754,
  "lng": 127.334,
  "addr": "천안시"
}

### 유저생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "정민우",
  "nickname": "황오라기",
  "password": "2342343",
  "email": "test1234@gmail.com"
}

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test1234@gmail.com",
  "password": "2342343"
}

### 유저인증 Guard API Test (로그인이 필요한 API 호출 시)
GET {{baseUrl}}/private
Content-Type: application/json